{"4236450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tattoo Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 4236450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Your Own Boss!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You rented a small shop with the last money in your pocket. Now it's time to show off your art and rewrite the rules of this town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/01ba486cf43b763503290e61fb08a7d2.webp?t=1787149854\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/d9ecd8f0a9a1bb64dfea4817a80c8a66.webp?t=1787149854\" alt=\"MANAGE YOUR OWN TATTOO SHOPS\" width=780 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to customer requests, choose the right design, and get to work. Earn money by providing tattoo and piercing services, but be careful; every mistake lowers customer satisfaction. Use different levels of tattoo machines, manage ink stocks, and keep your equipment in working order at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/42203308c7d77f53b024cde237de3533.poster.avif?t=1787149854\" aria-label=\"The player performs tattoos and piercings.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/42203308c7d77f53b024cde237de3533.webm?t=1787149854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/01ba486cf43b763503290e61fb08a7d2.webp?t=1787149854\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/60772ee2f8e1a3a3d3663cc5537fe716.webp?t=1787149854\" alt=\"EXPLORE THE CITY\" width=780 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't settle for just a tattoo shop! Use your earnings to buy cafes, pizzerias, and hotels in the city to generate passive income. Create extra revenue streams by acquiring hotdog and ice cream selling licenses. Roam freely with your motorcycle and explore the city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/4aea3bf91b3f64463e5c0aa43fca0e19.poster.avif?t=1787149854\" aria-label=\"The player rides different motorcycles.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/4aea3bf91b3f64463e5c0aa43fca0e19.webm?t=1787149854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/4aea3bf91b3f64463e5c0aa43fca0e19.mp4?t=1787149854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/01ba486cf43b763503290e61fb08a7d2.webp?t=1787149854\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/107a859e82cec6f309077fe3c94bf169.webp?t=1787149854\" alt=\"MANAGE YOUR TEAM AND GROW YOUR BUSINESS\" width=780 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track every detail of your business. Manage your inventory, monitor your shop's popularity and cleanliness. As your business grows, hire employees who each possess different skills. Maintain your financial balance through the banking app and keep your shop safe from bankruptcy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/6ebfd26450ab0e3cdf9af0f1f414493d.poster.avif?t=1787149854\" aria-label=\"The player cleans up.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/6ebfd26450ab0e3cdf9af0f1f414493d.webm?t=1787149854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/6ebfd26450ab0e3cdf9af0f1f414493d.mp4?t=1787149854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/01ba486cf43b763503290e61fb08a7d2.webp?t=1787149854\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/b580ef93747dce8d67f6bb633998cc36.webp?t=1787149854\" alt=\"DEFEND YOUR SHOPS\" width=780 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city's thugs are not open to change, so they might scare away your customers. Grab your bat and defend your shop! Stop these thugs from damaging your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/67d4d5e1cc4c31da8840e5cdc392f119.poster.avif?t=1787149854\" aria-label=\"The player chases someone.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/67d4d5e1cc4c31da8840e5cdc392f119.webm?t=1787149854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/67d4d5e1cc4c31da8840e5cdc392f119.mp4?t=1787149854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/01ba486cf43b763503290e61fb08a7d2.webp?t=1787149854\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/266676b006c0cd6a230b42c1c44a6911.webp?t=1787149854\" alt=\"BE READY FOR SURPRISES\" width=780 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city isn't always quiet and sunny. Changing weather conditions and city events can impact your entire business. Letters from the municipality can change your fate. Always be prepared for events happening in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/8b483a4a59650f2e2b5f79b00119b926.poster.avif?t=1787149854\" aria-label=\"The player checks out events in the city.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236450/extras/8b483a4a59650f2e2b5f79b00119b926.webm?t=1787149854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"http